entries[382266] = { ["name"] = "Fire Breath", ["text"] = "2.6% of base mana\nChanneled (3.25 sec cast) 30 sec cooldown\nInhale, stoking your inner flame. Release to exhale, burning enemies in a cone in front of you for [((163.409% of Spell Power)) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 ))] Fire damage, reduced beyond 5 targets. [ Sands of Time : Increases the duration of your active Ebon Might effects by 2 sec ]\nEmpowering causes more of the damage to be dealt immediately instead of over time.\n\nI: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 )] over (20 + 0 ) sec.\n\nII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 3)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (7 + 0 )] over (14 + 0 ) sec.\n\nIII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 6)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (4 + 0 )] over (8 + 0 ) sec.\n\nIV: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 9)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (1 + 0 )] over (2 + 0 ) sec." }
